    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>5th-level warlock feature</em></p><p>You can forge powerful, magical stones from your soul shards. You create a stone by expending a soul shard, which is done as an action. Once a stone has been created, it lasts until used, after which it crumbles to dust. You can only have a single stone of each type created at a time; creating an additional stone will cause the other stone to become inert.</p><p>You also gain the following: @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.ip511VFoaNxOWMDU]{Firestone}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.tLaVqxcT6m33QCuF]{Healthstone}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.0sxPdXiR1VCc0qll]{Soulstone}, and @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.4JLgJaxG5EHisBYB]{Spellstone}</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
